<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <title>ลงทะเบียนสมาชิก | ระบบข้อมูลนักศึกษา</title>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --ink: #20364f;
      --muted: #74859a;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 8% 8%, rgba(194, 224, 255, .7), transparent 32rem),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 94% 92%, rgba(213, 241, 238, .75), transparent 30rem),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #f7faff, #eff6ff 55%, #f8fcff);
    }

    .register-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .register-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 850px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .95);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(44, 88, 137, .13);
    }

    .register-header {
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f8;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      display: inline-grid;
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-radius: 19px;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #69a8f5, #3979d8);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(57, 121, 216, .24);
    }

    .register-subtitle {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .register-form {
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem 2.25rem;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .form-field-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .form-label {
      margin-bottom: .5rem;
      color: #344b65;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .form-control {
      min-height: 48px;
      border: 1px solid #dce6f1;
      border-radius: .8rem;
      background-color: #fbfdff;
    }

    .form-control::placeholder {
      color: #a0adbd;
    }

    .form-control:focus {
      border-color: #82b2f0;
      background-color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 .22rem rgba(57, 121, 216, .13);
    }

    .form-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: .75rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf2f8;
    }

    .form-actions .btn {
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: .65rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: .8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .btn-register {
      border: 0;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #4b8de7, #2864bd);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(57, 121, 216, .2);
    }

    .btn-register:hover,
    .btn-register:focus-visible {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #397fdc, #2059ad);
    }

    @media (max-width: 575.98px) {
      .register-page {
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .register-card {
        border-radius: 1.2rem;
      }

      .register-header {
        padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
      }

      .register-form {
        padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
      }

      .form-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .form-field-wide {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .form-actions {
        flex-direction: column-reverse;
      }

      .form-actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="container register-page">
  <section class="register-card" aria-labelledby="register-title">
    <header class="register-header">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M16 20v-1.5a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4V20M9.5 10.5a3.5 3.5 0 1 0 0-7 3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7ZM16 11h5M18.5 8.5v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <h1 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2" id="register-title">ลงทะเบียนสมาชิก</h1>
      <p class="register-subtitle mb-0">กรอกข้อมูลนักศึกษาเพื่อสร้างบัญชีผู้ใช้งาน</p>
    </header>

    <form class="register-form" action="/addData" method="post">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div>
          <label for="stCode" class="form-label">รหัสนักศึกษา</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stCode" placeholder="กรอกรหัสนักศึกษา 12 ตัว" name="stCode" autocomplete="off">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="stName" class="form-label">ชื่อ-นามสกุล</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stName" placeholder="กรอกชื่อ-นามสกุล" name="stName" autocomplete="name">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="stMajor" class="form-label">สาขาวิชา</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stMajor" placeholder="กรอกสาขาวิชา" name="stMajor">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="stAddress" class="form-label">ที่อยู่</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stAddress" placeholder="กรอกที่อยู่หรือจังหวัด" name="stAddress" autocomplete="address-level1">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="stPhone" class="form-label">เบอร์โทร</label>
          <input type="text" class="form-control" id="stPhone" placeholder="กรอกเบอร์โทรศัพท์" name="stPhone" autocomplete="tel">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="stEmail" class="form-label">อีเมล์</label>
          <input type="email" class="form-control" id="stEmail" placeholder="กรอกอีเมล์" name="stEmail" autocomplete="email">
        </div>

        <div class="form-field-wide">
          <label for="passWord" class="form-label">รหัสผ่าน</label>
          <input type="password" class="form-control" id="passWord" placeholder="กรอกรหัสผ่าน" name="passWord" autocomplete="new-password">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-actions">
        <button type="reset" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">ล้างข้อมูล</button>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-register">ลงทะเบียน</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
